<title>USA: Dr Pepper Bottling completes Seven-Up/RC tender.</title>
<headline>Dr Pepper Bottling completes Seven-Up/RC tender.</headline>
<dateline>DALLAS 1997-04-04</dateline>
<text>
<p>Dr Pepper Bottling Co of Texas on Friday said its DPB Acquisition Corp unit completed its tender offer for shares of Seven-Up/RC Bottling Co of Southern California Inc at $12 each.</p>
<p>The company said 4,071,961 shares of Seven-Up/RC Bottling were tendered and accepted for payment, representing about 77 percent of the issued and outstanding shares.</p>
</text>
